---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import CTABlock from '../../components/CTABlock.astro';
import { ROUTES } from '../../i18n/routes';
---

<Layout
  lang="en"
  active="terms"
  title="Terms & Conditions — Casa Lana"
  description="Terms and conditions for booking and staying at Casa Lana, Hondón de las Nieves."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap page-intro">
      <span class="eyebrow">Terms & Conditions</span>
      <h1>Terms & conditions</h1>
      <p class="draft-note">
        <strong>Draft.</strong> This text is a first draft based on our current booking
        practice and has not yet been legally reviewed. Details in [brackets] still need to be
        filled in before publishing.
      </p>
      <p>Last updated: [date].</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--tight">
    <div class="wrap legal">
      <h2>1. Scope</h2>
      <p>
        These terms and conditions apply to every booking of Casa Lana, located in Hondón de
        las Nieves (Alicante, Spain), agreed directly between the guest and the owner. By
        sending a request or confirming a booking, you agree to these terms.
      </p>

      <h2>2. The owner</h2>
      <p>
        Casa Lana is rented out by [owner name / legal entity], [address], [country],
        [company/NIE number if applicable]. Contact: [email address], [phone number].
      </p>

      <h2>3. Booking</h2>
      <p>
        A request via the booking form or by email is non-binding. The booking is only final
        once confirmed by the owner and the deposit described under "Payment" has been
        received.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Payment</h2>
      <ul class="legal-list">
        <li>Your booking is final once 50% of the total rental amount has been paid.</li>
        <li>The remaining amount is due at the latest one month before arrival.</li>
        <li>
          The security deposit is €800 and is also paid one month before arrival. After
          departure the house is checked; if everything is in order, the deposit is refunded
          within one week.
        </li>
        <li>The mandatory final cleaning fee is €150 per stay.</li>
        <li>
          Energy costs are included based on a standard usage of €8 electricity and €5 water
          per day. Usage above this standard is deducted from the deposit.
          <span class="fine-print">
            (Note: this arrangement will be confirmed once it's settled how usage is measured
            and billed.)
          </span>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Cancellation</h2>
      <ul class="legal-list">
        <li>Cancellation 8 weeks before the start of the rental period: 0% of the rental price.</li>
        <li>Cancellation 6 weeks before the start of the rental period: 25% of the rental price.</li>
        <li>Cancellation 2 weeks before the start of the rental period: 100% of the rental price.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="fine-print">
        Note: the arrangement for cancellations between 6 and 2 weeks before the start date
        still needs to be established.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Arrival and departure</h2>
      <ul class="legal-list">
        <li>Check-in is possible between 16:00 and 21:00. A fee of €25 applies for arrivals after 21:00.</li>
        <li>On the day of departure, we ask you to vacate the house by 11:00 at the latest.</li>
        <li>A keyholder will welcome you personally on arrival and give you the necessary information about the house.</li>
        <li><strong>Minimum stay</strong> — [to be confirmed]</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>7. House rules</h2>
      <ul class="legal-list">
        <li>Casa Lana sleeps a maximum of 6 people. Overcrowding is not allowed.</li>
        <li>We prefer not to welcome pets. Please contact us in advance with any specific questions.</li>
        <li>Smoking is not allowed indoors.</li>
        <li>
          Casa Lana is intended for a quiet stay with family or friends. Parties or events are
          not allowed, out of respect for the surroundings and the neighbours.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>8. Liability</h2>
      <p>
        The guest is liable for damage to the house, its contents or the grounds caused during
        the stay by the guest or their party. Such damage may be deducted from the deposit. The
        owner is not responsible for accidents, injury or theft during the stay.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Force majeure</h2>
      <p>
        In the event of force majeure (such as natural disasters, government measures or other
        circumstances beyond either party's control) that make the stay impossible, guest and
        owner will seek a reasonable solution together, such as rescheduling the rental period.
      </p>

      <h2>10. Complaints</h2>
      <p>
        Any issues during your stay should be reported immediately to the keyholder or directly
        to the owner, so a solution can be found quickly.
      </p>

      <h2>11. Governing law</h2>
      <p>
        This agreement is governed by [Spanish law, given the location of the property / to be
        confirmed]. Disputes will preferably be resolved amicably.
      </p>

      <h2>12. Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these terms. The version in force at the time of your booking continues
        to apply to that booking.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTABlock
    title="More questions about the terms?"
    text="Feel free to get in touch, we're happy to help."
    ctaLabel="Contact us"
    ctaHref={ROUTES.contact.en}
  />
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-intro {
    max-width: 68ch;
  }

  .draft-note {
    background: var(--color-cream-deep);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    padding: 0.9rem 1.1rem;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  .legal {
    max-width: 70ch;
  }

  .legal h2 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin-top: 2.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
  }

  .legal h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .legal p {
    color: #3a362c;
  }

  .legal-list {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 1.3rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: #3a362c;
    margin: 0 0 1em;
  }

  .fine-print {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.3rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #8a8577;
  }
</style>
